      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... it's always the same. i do the work, i follow the \"strategies\", and then i'm right back at the bottom. something about me is just broken. it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable at this point. like, why keep dragging this out just to fail again? it's just more pain for no reason.",
